# An ontology with nothing but its type: no title (the region gives it the
# placeholder one). A titled class and a labelled node beside it are not read.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix sdo: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix foaf: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .
@prefix doap: <http://usefulinc.com/ns/doap#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix vann: <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/onto#> .

<http://example.org/bare> a owl:Ontology .
ex:Thing a owl:Class ; dcterms:title "Not the ontology" .
